{"4515150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GUN MONKEY!", "steam_appid": 4515150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4803150], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gun Monkey! combines the flow of &quot;Donkey Kong Country&quot; with Metroidvania discovery and the unforgiving skill requirements of Rage Platformers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515150/extras/7a00fcd93b5be382817124734facd1cd.poster.avif?t=1786031822\" width=918 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515150/extras/7a00fcd93b5be382817124734facd1cd.webm?t=1786031822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515150/extras/7a00fcd93b5be382817124734facd1cd.mp4?t=1786031822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break out of the lab, liberate your fellow primates, and blast your way back to the freedom of the jungle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just another platformer. It is a brutal test of skill that challenges your technical skills in entirely new ways. Do you have the skills to survive the journey and reach the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive Game Loop</strong>: A &quot;just one more try&quot; experience that will keep you hooked for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reflexes to the Limit:</strong> Push your skills to the edge with tight and responsive controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insane Arsenal:</strong> From Pistols and SMGs to RPGs and the legendary Hotdog Gun (yes, seriously). Combine weapon recoil and fire rates to parkour through impossible heights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and Strats:</strong> Hunt for hidden Easter eggs and master grenade physics to forge your own path through the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Flow:</strong> Slow down time to nail the perfect shot or risk it all with a mid air reload to keep your momentum going!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Urban Jungle and Beyond</strong>: Escape the lab and navigate through a sprawling city toward the horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Circus Challenge:</strong> Conquer the traps of the Mad Clown and his twisted circus. Dodge massive hammers, punches, and falling debris in epic encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Haunted Castle:</strong> Navigate through a spooky ruin filled with ghostly obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beat the Dev:</strong> Think you are fast? Shatter my personal best to unlock exclusive special items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero or Survivor:</strong> The fate of your fellow primates is in your hands. Rescue every last companion or leave them to their demise in your pursuit for freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Banana Upgrades:</strong> Collect bananas and trade them with Bullet Boy and upgrade your abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment Insurance: We included fair checkpoints so you do not smash your controller or keyboard in a rage. You are welcome!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>A Note from the Developer:</strong></i></u><i> This game is a solo passion project. If you encounter any bugs or mistakes, please be patient and report them. I am working hard to make this the best experience possible. Thank you for playing! :)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gun Monkey! combines the flow of &quot;Donkey Kong Country&quot; with Metroidvania discovery and the unforgiving skill requirements of Rage Platformers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515150/extras/7a00fcd93b5be382817124734facd1cd.poster.avif?t=1786031822\" width=918 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515150/extras/7a00fcd93b5be382817124734facd1cd.webm?t=1786031822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515150/extras/7a00fcd93b5be382817124734facd1cd.mp4?t=1786031822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break out of the lab, liberate your fellow primates, and blast your way back to the freedom of the jungle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just another platformer. It is a brutal test of skill that challenges your technical skills in entirely new ways. Do you have the skills to survive the journey and reach the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive Game Loop</strong>: A &quot;just one more try&quot; experience that will keep you hooked for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reflexes to the Limit:</strong> Push your skills to the edge with tight and responsive controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insane Arsenal:</strong> From Pistols and SMGs to RPGs and the legendary Hotdog Gun (yes, seriously). Combine weapon recoil and fire rates to parkour through impossible heights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and Strats:</strong> Hunt for hidden Easter eggs and master grenade physics to forge your own path through the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Flow:</strong> Slow down time to nail the perfect shot or risk it all with a mid air reload to keep your momentum going!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Urban Jungle and Beyond</strong>: Escape the lab and navigate through a sprawling city toward the horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Circus Challenge:</strong> Conquer the traps of the Mad Clown and his twisted circus. Dodge massive hammers, punches, and falling debris in epic encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Haunted Castle:</strong> Navigate through a spooky ruin filled with ghostly obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beat the Dev:</strong> Think you are fast? Shatter my personal best to unlock exclusive special items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero or Survivor:</strong> The fate of your fellow primates is in your hands. Rescue every last companion or leave them to their demise in your pursuit for freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Banana Upgrades:</strong> Collect bananas and trade them with Bullet Boy and upgrade your abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment Insurance: We included fair checkpoints so you do not smash your controller or keyboard in a rage. You are welcome!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>A Note from the Developer:</strong></i></u><i> This game is a solo passion project. If you encounter any bugs or mistakes, please be patient and report them. I am working hard to make this the best experience possible. Thank you for playing! :)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Help your fellow monkeys escape back to the jungle by gunning your way through obstacles and challenges. Test your skill in a open environment and find your way home! Choose how you want to play, save companions (or don't) and unlock guns that help you traverse the world!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*